                      <Value EvaluationMode="Constant">N.B. : 1) Payment should be made by Cheque / Draft on Mumbai Branch within agreed terms of this Invoice otherwise ineterest at the rate of 18% p.a shall be charged 2) The Company does not hold itself responsible for any loss or damage which occurs in transit after delivery of packages to the Railway or other carrying Agency except for goods sent under its own indemnity gurantee system 3) Please Notify carries immediately of damage 4) Advice us within SEVEN DAYS if any discrepancies or damages, otherwise no claim will be entertained</Value>
